  "summary": [
    "$560,000 of new ARR closing 2027-01-01 to 2027-03-31 needs 22 deals and 96 opportunities created 2026-11-02 to 2027-01-30, at your 23.0% win rate and $22,900 average deal.",
    "Today's run rate gives 79.1 opportunities in that window, 16.9 short.",
    "In-market channels cannot carry this target. Baseline plus every capture channel at its ceiling gives 63.2 of the 96 opportunities (65.8%). The other 32.8 must come from outbound and demand creation, and creation leads take 38 to 45 days to become opportunities, so creation spend added now mostly builds next quarter's pipeline.",
    "Cheapest added opportunities first: Outbound: fill current SDR capacity ($109 each); Review sites: scale to 1.5x ($2,782 each); LinkedIn retargeting: scale to 1.5x ($3,661 each); Microsoft Ads non-brand search: budget headroom ($4,164 each). Google Ads non-brand loses 21.9% of its eligible clicks to budget, so its headroom comes at today's cost per click.",
    "The plan reaches 97.1 opportunities, enough for the target, with one new SDR from 2026-11-09.",
    "90-day program cost $309,076; CAC $13,867; payback 9.1 months at 80.0% gross margin."
  ],
  "step_1_backward_calculator": {
    "close_window": [
      "2027-01-01",
      "2027-03-31"
    ],
    "opportunity_window": [
      "2026-11-02",
      "2027-01-30"
    ],
    "steps": [
      {
        "step": "Win rate",
        "formula": "won / (won + lost), closed in the last 12 months",
        "inputs": "54 / (54 + 181)",
        "result": "23.0%"
      },
      {
        "step": "Average new deal",
        "formula": "first-year value of won deals / won deals",
        "inputs": "$1,236,600 / 54",
        "result": "$22,900"
      },
      {
        "step": "Expected from open pipeline",
        "formula": "open value closing in the window x win rate",
        "inputs": "$249,500 x 23.0%",
        "result": "$57,332"
      },
      {
        "step": "Revenue gap",
        "formula": "target - expected from open pipeline",
        "inputs": "$560,000 - $57,332",
        "result": "$502,668"
      },
      {
        "step": "Deals",
        "formula": "gap / average deal, rounded up",
        "inputs": "$502,668 / $22,900",
        "result": 22
      },
      {
        "step": "Opportunities",
        "formula": "deals / win rate, rounded up",
        "inputs": "22 / 23.0%",
        "result": 96
      },
      {
        "step": "SQLs (blended inbound rate)",
        "formula": "opportunities / SQL to opportunity",
        "inputs": "96 / 43.8%",
        "result": 220
      },
      {
        "step": "MQLs (blended inbound rate)",
        "formula": "SQLs / MQL to SQL",
        "inputs": "220 / 37.2%",
        "result": 592
      },
      {
        "step": "Leads (blended inbound rate)",
        "formula": "MQLs / lead to MQL",
        "inputs": "592 / 59.0%",
        "result": 1003
      }
    ],
    "timing": "Deals that close 2027-01-01 to 2027-03-31 come from opportunities created one median cycle (60 days) earlier: 2026-11-02 to 2027-01-30. That is the 90-day plan window.",
    "blended_warning": "The blended line (1,003 leads) assumes every opportunity comes from inbound at the average rate. The channel plan gets 72.8 opportunities from 768 inbound leads (9.5% lead to opportunity, against 9.6% blended) and 24.2 from 5,700 outbound contacts. Plan and track on the channel math."
  },
